   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project documents being developed partner ( tentative dates placed for now):PLEASE AMEND PROJECT DETAILS ACCORDINGLY&#xa0;
The Molham Business Center in Damascus aims to contribute to Syria&#x2019;s socio-economic recovery by empowering youth to establish sustainable businesses and strengthening small NGOs to deliver impactful programs. Through a dynamic hub offering affordable workspaces, targeted training, small grants, and mentorship, the center will foster innovation, collaboration, and sustainable growth. This initiative will build the capacity of youth entrepreneurs and NGOs to address community needs, drive economic growth, and contribute to Syria&#x2019;s long-term development.</narrative>
